These .wasm files are third-party software redistributed with J.H AI Agent.
This file travels with them because a compiled .wasm carries no notice of its own,
and MIT requires the notice to be included in copies. Full detail, including the
outstanding item on the grammar binaries, is in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md at the repo
root.

